&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/i5FaOgU1ncL0/v1/-1x-1.jpg" alt="Image associated with story &amp;quot;Iran Risks Losing Key Economic Lifeline With UAE Halting Trade&amp;quot;" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="与故事“伊朗因阿联酋停止贸易而面临失去关键经济命脉的风险”相关图片" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/i5FaOgU1ncL0/v1/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: normal; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;伊朗战争&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !important;"&gt;阿联酋贸易暂停导致伊朗面临失去关键经济命脉的风险&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;切断与德黑兰经济联系的决定可能会给伊朗伊斯兰共和国带来更多痛苦。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 24px 0 0 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;饱受打击的比特币市场突然起死回生&lt;/strong&gt;， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/H8oJ9ttOs91RlqD8a5UPN1QAPkUErB8PnRHPBCnvhLgB1T3kFl3gk_HfZE_TKJygsvdYxIKkT_-wdw1kbIRBZt9jdYYUzFJuv7TtEVcbak75UOd8BzrqJxpCwcbCmivtfDAAHFCmm0fd-CSPTLMdSKN301JBz3tiQgAZxiNgodIhuHXu92xETJmYt0_OVNem2haH6UMXFwFpAUuOBSVt9lEvkBETudyMxyAqDfl5DaFR-RaJnd3PCLyL2qmjpgKj7mmm_lGO8XTZCIjyicyrQIb_fhB0GyKp4tmZCVuUXJ_M4Pa53JjiOsrUOEberY8OOgUW6b3PPa3dbPKjs2xPD9de6R4ePKM7rlgc7BNyfc03nh8G0C4TnaL3DACDWQEuxvhzO9v88AbmgJ1jGzaTtUsjp2tVC0JxEq9iHMY7ywm7XDZ6BrGKYwuP40QvFks0T_vg_TbHfTZZnGp4Qjh7N1dobh62oq4SAppp5p__v0lHZtf4zc2my4wdrJ8jh_oTjFWq2gU1Vw6ZcG0qwEb9TKwWJQ/Sc0RbBCRSRbCT5fVjBnwfTN2AwczRhrF/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="比特币空头挤压在饱受打击的加密货币体系中激起涟漪"&gt;飙升近 8%，并引发了自 2021 年以来有记录以来最大规模的空头清算浪潮。&lt;/a&gt;超过 10 亿美元的比特币空头头寸在大约一个小时内被清算，突显了反转的速度，将最大的加密货币推至 69,500 美元左右，为 6 月初以来的最高水平。你问为什么会发生这种事？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;答案是特朗普。总统从&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/SUBrHrx2N5Ys1F0aivP3aVn_l9Hb53gdhoACfbY95mNjhwsblAAwiyVsd8yOo57SLWLYYnWsW7J72wmNOut_BfrvReEVGhyVp2ueGS8WvPHlzrIh0xuTS76rH0ZcPqG4RsIM5qIlmlAGib5vT6Bq_g0Tk3Z4h9JFIRNLMza3e8CnyBf1sVzB2nJJObntl8KSnsv8Fx7ShVZIipGrsT_7VpCU2K_Czbk3Sno3-7SEOw1asmPdr_UppJEBK1mVWQQynRdiWXFHgRzykiuox57X6iJ4J5SCqVdf1oyJQvZSd6DVFmqnG4lxdyMKhMy8CP-XZmBzbt2vA_qusLUL9VaZguyF2-DAz9DmEPIyhnICJtW1peNnIJXSytOqfszbH8NPrPFqgfijhb_vBF3rjSkUQcIr-VW1k2I3cU-9kKdN-sYN1GtMSaJ2PK_QWcEbfnPG-DRzSRWt22rLo9bcI81bxTL35mnl7zvP5yvDW__dzaCu71czRlSZqykovcbi3ZpIxum4RRYpkwXVKpLUjgZZ2oR9VWCuCQ/PqHSlLmxpbzss_Bx9pibm1HXp8Lh6o5G/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="参议院民主党高层呼吁调查特朗普的加密货币收入"&gt;备受争议的加密货币事业&lt;/a&gt;中获利颇丰，他在白宫会见了 Coinbase Global、Payward 和 Blockchain.com 等公司的加密货币高管，这增加了人们对他将寻求进一步放松对该行业监管的乐观情绪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/yPKga2-APu9-0E5se_Mu-aNg4I7fmhP5dppIhChfbnPjlYYbSSSNSH7IPp9KVVAyKIUt9nA3Jw-klnPTnBvmAvzezOewxqw3UsUPATqD9qnulYmOi0lpNqUmWWtRveQV-H-yv-R5fpNPqA-iqia8Nzp8j2StibXOLDYhWKlLyRrF3L0PcNW2i78rmYH96V0CXg5R691Hpxj8dh5pLSHRXgvKocu-ZfZfB6Il2c0uFtcQkhM6c8qMhXgdTZa1Tt1lF9KA2Pt7yf-tl7mVOqmq6SZO0k3X6zIRETehP2ys7b-kQemhwL9AaPxT9yz9r67csNeSuqI9L-UBlw0x1ImxxRwCxsxHrvQHv9PJ7uGTQeEoPXq8NAiVAVY99Yi7uYdOQVCxQqlCio960n18L-D2T2vJlTRFti_Tmu1Go_j-VivsjlXuUbOhAFIPG2Uq4yfCKKn753UfWhV_39sGkyyQ5c4a70aaqto_CZ3vHIxfqgLMWhcRvjJZHFYRZrDBG2dYeWZhQklbAf0HdlGZYK8T6O1RNQ/ZSO24XiLHGzmC3qOePb9W7Zc1aCKZOle/23" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;t